# Attachment upload = encrypt.lu Safari single PUT (+ hybrid)

## Recipe (must match or Safari aborts)

| Requirement | Value |
|---|---|
| Page origin | `privatenote.ai` / `premium.privatenote.ai` (not `*.pages.dev`) |
| Upload origin | `upload.privatenote.ai` / `upload-staging.privatenote.ai` |
| Same-site | yes |
| Transport | **XHR only on Safari** (never `fetch` for the body) |
| Body | one untyped Blob (`type: ""`) |
| Method | PUT |
| Auth | `Authorization: Bearer <token>`, then query-token fallback |
| Cookies | `withCredentials = false` / `credentials: "omit"` |
| Proxy | never Pages `/api` for the binary body |

## Default path (Chrome always; Safari ≤ ~6 MiB)

1. `POST /api/notes/reserve` → note id + upload token
2. One ciphertext Blob (one secretstream FINAL frame)
3. Safari: XHR `PUT …/file` + Bearer → on transport error wait ~1.8s → retry; then PUT + `?uploadToken=`
4. Chrome: fetch PUT + Bearer, then PUT/POST + query token
5. Await warm-up `GET /api/health` on the relay
6. SPA create-note: **no COEP/COOP** (COEP only on `/llm-ui` + `/test-llm`)
7. Relay CORS: echo Origin, Allow-Methods PUT/POST/OPTIONS, Allow-Headers Authorization (+ Content-Type) — **no** Allow-Credentials

## Safari > ~6 MiB (WebKit single-PUT cliff around ~20+ MiB)

Do **not** spam 1 MiB POSTs. Use few serial ~4 MiB secretstream frames + XHR PUT `/file/chunks/:i` with the same Bearer → query shapes.

Gate: `usesSingleBlobAttachmentUpload(file.size)` / `SAFARI_SINGLE_BLOB_MAX_BYTES`.

## Mapping

| encrypt.lu | PrivateNote |
|---|---|
| `relay.encrypt.lu` | `upload.privatenote.ai` / `upload-staging.privatenote.ai` |
| `POST /api/init-upload` | `POST /api/notes/reserve` |
| `PUT /api/upload/:id` | `PUT /api/notes/:id/file` |
| — | `PUT /api/notes/:id/file/chunks/:i` (Safari large only, few 4 MiB) |
